{"id":2321,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>根据《中北大学专业技术职务任职资格评审管理办法（2025 版）》文件的相关要求，我院于2025年12月8日上午8:30，在机械大楼316会议室召开“2025年度机械工程学院职称评议推荐评审会议”。按照学校核定的指标数额，经过个人答辩、投票等评审环节，学科评议组一致同意推荐以下6位同志晋升副教授职务：</p><p>具体推荐名单如下：</p><div><div><table><colgroup><col data-offset-left=\"60.88169479370117\" data-offset-right=\"114.42522048950195\" data-resize-pixel=\"53.54352569580078\" data-resize-percent=\"7.594826339829898\"><col data-offset-left=\"114.42522430419922\" data-offset-right=\"213.89508819580078\" data-resize-pixel=\"99.46986389160156\" data-resize-percent=\"14.109200552000223\"><col data-offset-left=\"213.89508056640625\" data-offset-right=\"330.5803451538086\" data-resize-pixel=\"116.68526458740234\" data-resize-percent=\"16.551101359915226\"><col data-offset-left=\"330.5803527832031\" data-offset-right=\"429.08760833740234\" data-resize-pixel=\"98.50725555419922\" data-resize-percent=\"13.972660362297763\"><col data-offset-left=\"429.0876159667969\" data-offset-right=\"537.1930847167969\" data-resize-pixel=\"108.10546875\" data-resize-percent=\"15.334109042553193\"><col data-offset-left=\"537.1930541992188\" data-offset-right=\"645.2985229492188\" data-resize-pixel=\"108.10546875\" data-resize-percent=\"15.334109042553193\"><col data-offset-left=\"645.2985229492188\" data-offset-right=\"764.0926055908203\" data-resize-pixel=\"118.79408264160156\" data-resize-percent=\"16.850224488170433\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p>序号</p></td><td><p>姓名</p></td><td><p>申报学科</p></td><td><p>申报职务</p></td><td><p>申报类型</p></td><td><p>申报方式</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">是否校任副教授</td></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>李率</p></td><td><p>机械工程</p></td><td><p>副教授</p></td><td><p>教学科研型</p></td><td><p>正常晋升</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">是</td></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>范振芳</p></td><td><p>机械工程</p></td><td><p>副教授</p></td><td><p>教学科研型</p></td><td><p>正常晋升</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">是</td></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>任维波</p></td><td><p>机械工程</p></td><td><p>副教授</p></td><td><p>教学科研型</p></td><td><p>正常晋升</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">是</td></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>张雅君</p></td><td><p>机械工程</p></td><td><p>副教授</p></td><td><p>教学科研型</p></td><td><p>正常晋升</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">否</td></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>赵宇芳</p></td><td><p>机械工程</p></td><td><p>副教授</p></td><td><p>教学科研型</p></td><td><p>正常晋升</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">否</td></tr><tr><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>李娇娇</p></td><td><p>机械工程</p></td><td><p>副教授</p></td><td><p>教学科研型</p></td><td><p>正常晋升</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">否</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>如有疑问，请及时与机械工程学院综合办公室联系（由于办公楼新址无固话网络，请拨打手机号13834048544）。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;机械工程学院</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2025年12月8日</p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":null}